nt-weight: bold;\"> 687</span> 点基本攻击(自动)</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 81px;\"><td class=\"\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"><p><strong>重击（NS）</strong></p></div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\">给予目标 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">2550 </span>点伤害、<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">90.1% </span>机率 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">15 </span>秒内我方攻击型的2名成员「觉醒」(爆学伤害+30%并依增益效果数量增加SS技能伤害) 、 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">90.1% </span>机率<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"> 8</span> 秒内我方剩余HP最多的2名成员免疫「气绝」与「强打」</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 81px;\"><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"><p><strong>重击U</strong></p></div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">给予目标 <span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212); font-weight: bold;\">2575 </span>点伤害、<span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212); font-weight: bold;\">95.1% </span>机率 <span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212); font-weight: bold;\">2 回合 </span>内我方攻击型的2名成员「觉醒」(爆学伤害+30%并依增益效果数量增加SS技能伤害) 、 <span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212); font-weight: bold;\">95.1%</span> 机率 8 秒内我方剩余HP最多的2名成员免疫「气绝」与「强打」</div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 62px;\"><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"><p><strong>滑动（SS）</strong></p></div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\">给予敌方随机2名目标 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">4003 </span>点伤害、我方攻击型的3名成员 <span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2</span> 回合内暴击率<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">+70.1% </span>&amp; 暴击伤害<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"> +100% </span>、世界王限定效果:我方暗属性攻击型的5名成员SS技能最终伤害 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">+90.1%</span></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 62px;\"><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"><p><strong>滑动U</strong></p></div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">给予敌方随机2名目标 <span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(84, 141, 212);\">4103&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;点伤害、我方攻击型的3名成员 <span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(84, 141, 212);\">3&nbsp;</span>回合内暴击率<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(84, 141, 212);\">+75.1%</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"> </span>&amp; 暴击伤害<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"> +100%</span> 、世界王限定效果:我方暗属性攻击型的5名成员SS技能最终伤害 <span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212); font-weight: bold;\">+105.1%</span></div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 81px;\"><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"><p><strong>大招（DS）</strong></p></div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\">给予敌方随机3名目标 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">6824 </span>点伤害、我方攻击型的5名成员 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">20 </span>秒内NS技能最终伤害<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"> +80%</span>、世界王限定效果:我方暗属性攻击型的5名成员追加「攻击态势」效果(FEVER TIME时只让持有此效果的角色进行攻击)</div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 81px;\"><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"><p><strong>大招U</strong></p></div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">剩余HP最少的敌人优先,给予 <span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:bold;\">3</span> 名目标<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:bold;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(84, 141, 212);\">7487</span> 点伤害、<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:bold;\">16 </span>秒内&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(84, 141, 212);\">85%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:bold;\"> </span>机率追加「致命回复」(恢复量转换为等量伤害、吸血/ HP吸收例外)、<span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">85%</span> </span>机率追加「魅惑」(无法给予目标增益效果、不可解除)</div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 43px;\"><td><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\"><p><strong>队长技</strong></p></div></td><td class=\"\" colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"position: static; min-height: 20px; width: auto;\">我方暗属性成员的暴击发生率 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">+20%&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><div>( 世界王时再追加暴击伤害<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"> +40% </span>)</div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div><br><br><br><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">天子评价</span></p></div><br></div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">出生以来，一直是顶级辅助，无论再PVP，还是PVE，都是神一般的存在，你可能没有强力刀，但是你不能没有强力的辅助，鲁邦就是这样一位天子。</div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">当你看到点火的变化，有人可能会问了，好像没提升多少，那么她到底要不要点火呢，回答是肯定的，因为点火下，会多 5%暴击率，让你的刀更容易达成全程暴击，WB副本中少刀一个暴击的SS可能就差了好几百万伤害，更重要的是点火之后,NS技能带来的改变，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:left;\">「觉醒」buff从16秒变成2回合，这样基本能达成全程buff的状态，对伤害的提升是巨大的</span>。</div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">总结，优先点火，最低情况把NS技能改造一下。</div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:auto;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;---奶牛 2021.06.24</div>\n                  <i class=\"border-i-top\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:rgb(0,0,0);z-index:2147483647;\"></i><i class=\"border-i-right\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:rgb(0,0,0);